      "text": "The Ballon d'Or is brass inside.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "hook"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mellerio, a Paris jewelry house, has made every Ballon d'Or since 1956.",
      "say": "Mellerio, a Paris jewelry house, has made every Ballon d'Or since nineteen fifty six.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "1956",
        "sub": "Mellerio",
        "piece": "necklace",
        "stone": "amethyst",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "cut": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Under a thin layer of gold, the trophy is brass.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "real",
        "src": "465-the-ballon-d-or-is-brass-inside-0.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "label": "A piece of brass",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Two brass halves are welded together to form the ball.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "earrings",
        "stone": "topaz",
        "cut": "pear",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "Two brass halves"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ball is filled with a mixture called cement.",
      "scene": {
