        "piece": "band",
        "stone": "emerald",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "Filled with cement"
      },
      "hold": 0.5
    },
    {
      "text": "That lets the metal be pushed out to show the seams.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "brooch",
        "stone": "amethyst",
        "cut": "round",
        "petals": 8,
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "Pushed out"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An engraver then draws the seams by hand.",
      "scene": {
